   "id": "a2736b41-8e07-69d4-2192-ce7f54e14df8",
   "text": {
    "html": "<h6 class=\"heading-xsmall\">A finely ground Da Hong Pao (Big Red Robe) tea powder from the Wuyi Mountains of Fujian. Complex mineral-roasted rock oolong with orchid fragrance and lasting sweetness.<br data-w-id=\"5240ca72-6e9a-511a-4509-17d16d73d92f\"><br data-w-id=\"51eafc03-71c1-48fb-8419-61f8115d4cf1\">Deep mineral complexity with a smoky-roasted finish and natural floral undertones — perfect for premium oolong lattes, specialty tea beverages and elevated café menus. Available in bulk wholesale supply for premium beverage brands and specialty cafés. The legendary rock oolong.<br data-w-id=\"c1a9cbb3-5615-e03d-5e47-d6ffa058f23d\"><br data-w-id=\"5f5d77c3-7a2c-36a9-5bd3-413cf6d1cd19\">Available through our <a data-wf-link-page-id=\"698ed39e8999d2a9cf8e7e17\" data-w-id=\"27937949-256f-2b38-c995-04df5efdf38e\">wholesale bulk supply </a>programs.</h6>",
    "text": "A finely ground Da Hong Pao (Big Red Robe) tea powder from the Wuyi Mountains of Fujian. Complex mineral-roasted rock oolong with orchid fragrance and lasting sweetness.\n\nDeep mineral complexity with a smoky-roasted finish and natural floral undertones — perfect for premium oolong lattes, specialty tea beverages and elevated café menus. Available in bulk wholesale supply for premium beverage brands and specialty cafés. The legendary rock oolong.\n\nAvailable through our wholesale bulk supply programs."
   },
   "attributes": {}
